{"4652090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ホワイトノウェイ（Stay on the white lines）", "steam_appid": 4652090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you were still in elementary school, do you remember walking along the white lines on the sidewalk on your way home from school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back then, everything you saw felt fresh and fun, and even though you led a joyful life full of excitement every day, as your days passed in a flurry of activity didn’t you eventually lose sight of those little joys you used to feel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could relive those memories from back then through a game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move the boy’s feet by clicking and dragging the cursor.<br>Release the click to place his feet on the white line, and move them alternately to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry if you go outside the white line.<br>You can resume play right from where you were just before you fell.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you pick up a treasure, the surroundings will transform into a world of imagination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, let’s dive into this world of imagination together with the boy!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you were still in elementary school, do you remember walking along the white lines on the sidewalk on your way home from school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back then, everything you saw felt fresh and fun, and even though you led a joyful life full of excitement every day, as your days passed in a flurry of activity didn’t you eventually lose sight of those little joys you used to feel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could relive those memories from back then through a game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move the boy’s feet by clicking and dragging the cursor.<br>Release the click to place his feet on the white line, and move them alternately to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/c70c0c1226d15f8898ca78e0b7dfefd7.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/6e4b201bf637cf9db633ba07efdbafd0.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry if you go outside the white line.<br>You can resume play right from where you were just before you fell.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/d8bfc4bfe99138600bc628b9907b90db.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you pick up a treasure, the surroundings will transform into a world of imagination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.poster.avif?t=1788185286\" width=1170 height=734 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.webm?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/extras/f73092c61f4874e8bf03a9dfeb354adc.mp4?t=1788185286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, let’s dive into this world of imagination together with the boy!</strong></p>", "short_description": "One day after school, a boy walks home along a white line. His curfew is 5:00 p.m. The white line is filled with treasures that spark his imagination, turning the walk home into an adventure. Become that boy and journey through Hakusen, the childhood sanctuary where imagination comes to life.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/cdadb606e7c1e6549398dcf61a4b5fe793a73cbb/header.jpg?t=1788185286", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/0e385ed67d5412f76b33ec59766349acda0e1e71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788185286", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652090/0e385ed67d5412f76b33ec59766349acda0e1e71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788185286", "website": "https://linktr.ee/pistachiogekohan", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Pistachio Gekouhan